**Zombies**: you can't live with them, and they can't live without
your brains. Slow and mindless, they make up for their feeble offense
with sheer numbers and a refusal to stay dead. *Attack +1, Tough +2,
Unique Ability (Turns Defeated into Zombies) +3; Clumsy -1, Dense -3,
Slow -2, Vulnerability (Fire) -2, Vulnerability (Head Shots) -2.*

